    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Travel is a multipurpose theme created for voyage and hospitality websites, designed to showcase travel services in a visually appealing and structured way. It is suitable for travel explore agencies, tour operators, hotels, resorts, and related businesses that want to present their offerings in a professional format. The design follows a clean and minimal layout focused on clear content presentation, ensuring that users can easily navigate through different sections without distraction. The theme ensures compatibility across different screen sizes and devices, providing a smooth browsing experience on desktops, tablets, and mobile phones. It is retina-ready and structured with optimized code for stable performance and easier maintenance. Customization options allow adjustments to colors, typography, layouts, and homepage sections so users can align the design with their brand identity. Built-in sections include a banner area with a travel search form, helping visitors quickly find relevant trips and services. Moreover, the other sections include a city section where you can list destinations and a Blog seaside section to share travel stories, guides, and updates."
    },
